<title>USA: Westvaco sells $150 mln in debentures.</title>
<headline>Westvaco sells $150 mln in debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Westvaco Corp was priced on Wednesday, according to lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER WESTVACO CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.65 PCT   MATURITY 3/15/2027</p>
<p>TYPE SINKING FUND  ISS PRICE 99.486  FIRST PAY DATE 9/15/1997</p>
<p>DEBENTURES</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1    YIELD  7.694 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD 77 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678))</p>
</text>
